Database Design
The project uses a database named hospital_2026.
It contains four tables:
Patients Table
Stores patient information including:
•	Patient ID
•	Name
•	Age
•	Gender
•	Phone Number
•	Address
•	Blood Group
•	Admission Date
Doctors Table
Stores doctor details:
•	Doctor ID
•	Doctor Name
•	Specialization
•	Phone Number
•	Consultation Fees
Appointments Table
Maintains appointment records:
•	Appointment ID
•	Patient ID
•	Doctor ID
•	Appointment Date
•	Appointment Status
Billing Table
Stores financial information:
•	Bill ID
•	Patient ID
•	Amount
•	Bill Date
•	Payment Status
