Project Modules
1. Patient Management Module
This module manages all patient-related information. It performs complete CRUD operations.
Main Functions:
•	Add Patient
•	View Patient Records
•	Search Patient by ID
•	Update Patient Information
•	Delete Patient Record
Patient details are stored permanently in the MySQL database and can be modified whenever required.
________________________________________
2. Doctor Management Module
This module stores doctor details and specialization information.
Functions:
•	Add Doctor
•	Display Doctor List
•	Search Doctor by Specialization
•	Update Consultation Fees
•	Delete Doctor Record
The search functionality helps users quickly find doctors based on their medical specialization.
________________________________________
3. Appointment Management Module
The appointment module allows scheduling appointments between patients and doctors.
Main Features:
•	Book Appointment
•	View All Appointments
•	Update Appointment Status
•	View Doctor-wise Appointments
Appointment status can be:
•	Scheduled
•	Completed
•	Cancelled
This module ensures better organization of patient visits and doctor availability.
________________________________________
4. Billing Management Module
The billing module records patient billing details.
Functions include:
•	Add New Bill
•	View Bills
•	View Pending Bills
•	Mark Bills as Paid
•	Display Collection Summary
The billing summary helps hospital administrators monitor revenue collection and outstanding payments.
________________________________________
5. Graph Module
The Graph Module generates graphical reports using Matplotlib.
Available reports include:
•	Patient Distribution by Gender
•	Doctors by Specialization
•	Appointment Status Distribution
•	Billing Status (Paid vs Pending)
These visualizations make it easier to analyze hospital data and identify trends.
________________________________________
6. Main Menu Module
The Main Menu serves as the central control system of the application.
It provides access to all project modules through a simple menu-driven interface.
An important feature of this module is exception handling. If any runtime error occurs, the program displays the error message and automatically restarts after a short delay, improving the application's reliability.
________________________________________
Working of the System
1.	The application starts from the Main Menu.
2.	The user selects a desired module.
3.	Data is entered through keyboard input.
4.	Python validates the input.
5.	SQL queries are executed on the MySQL database.
6.	The database is updated.
7.	Required information is displayed.
8.	Graphical reports can be generated whenever needed.
